---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How this website handles your information.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">
      <span class="label">
        <span class="n">~/</span>privacy
      </span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Short version: this site has no tracking, no analytics and no cookies. The only information I receive is what
        you choose to send me.
      </p>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        {site.legalName} ("John Kuria") runs this website and decides how messages sent through it are used. Contact:{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email, topic and message. These are sent through FormSubmit, which
          may process them outside Kenya, and delivered to my email.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>WhatsApp, email or social links:</strong> if you use them, that platform's own privacy policy applies.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Hosting:</strong> GitHub Pages may log basic technical data, such as IP addresses, to keep the site
          secure.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How it is used</h2>
      <p>
        Only to read and reply to your message. It is never sold or used for marketing. Messages are kept for up to 12
        months after our last contact unless an ongoing project needs them longer.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under Kenya's Data Protection Act, 2019 you can ask to see, correct or delete your information, or object to its
        use. Email me with the subject "Privacy request". You can also complain to the Office of the Data Protection
        Commissioner.
      </p>

      <h2>Providers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub privacy statement
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            FormSubmit privacy policy
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="muted">Last updated 13 October 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
